			message: '#^Parameter \#1 \$callback of function array_map expects \(callable\(PhpParser\\Node\\Arg\|PhpParser\\Node\\ArgPlaceholder\|PhpParser\\Node\\VariadicPlaceholder\)\: mixed\)\|null, Closure\(PhpParser\\Node\\Arg\)\: mixed given\.$#'
